# Camera-original screen recordings. The re-encodes beside them are what ships
# (native resolution, CRF 32 — roughly a third of the size at a difference you
# cannot see at fullscreen). Masters stay out of git because history is
# permanent: committing 18 MB and re-encoding later leaves both copies in the
# pack forever. Keep them backed up somewhere outside this repo.
solution/video/raw/
